{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"github-night","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Hub Night","description":"A neutral dark theme in the style of a code hosting site.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Hub Night","path":"themes/github-night.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/github-night.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Hub Night\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#0d1117\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#c9d1d9\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#010409\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#010409\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#010409\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#010409\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#161b22\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#264f78\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#0d1117\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#010409\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#30363d\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#1f6feb\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#1f6feb\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#1f6feb\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#264f78\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#161b2280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#1f6feb\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#30363d\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f85149\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#3fb950\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#d29922\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f85149\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8b949e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a5d6ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79c0ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ff7b72\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffa657\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d2a8ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79c0ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79c0ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7ee787\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#79c0ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffa657\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Hub Night\n\nA neutral dark theme in the style of a code hosting site.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Hub Night** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the GitHub Primer dark colors (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#0d1117` |\n| Text | `#c9d1d9` |\n| Accent | `#1f6feb` |\n| Keywords | `#ff7b72` |\n| Strings | `#a5d6ff` |\n| Functions | `#d2a8ff` |\n| Types | `#ffa657` |\n| Comments | `#8b949e` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}